{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515710/extras/forgive50.gif?t=1751305919\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Long ago, there was a group of scholars on a journey.  <br>They searched not for wisdom, but for a doorway.<br>A method to gain entry into the sacred realm where no mortal was meant to tread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They were approached by a stranger offering this forbidden knowledge. <br>A powerful god who guided them along a mysterious path.  <br>But the god was not granting a gift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>It was delivering a punishment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515710/extras/ash.gif?t=1751305919\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What they entered was not heaven, but a place of decay.<br>A hollow reflection devoid of life, a colorless sky filled with nothing but vibrant ash drifting through the stagnant air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What happened next changes with each telling.<br>But always, one left.  <br>And the others remained behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515710/extras/huddle2.gif?t=1751305919\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three girls chased that same ancient myth.<br>They met strangers at the end of a long, overgrown path.<br>A door to another plane was opened.<br><br>And with one misstep, their lives were shattered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515710/extras/choice.gif?t=1751305919\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Ten years have passed since that event took place, and what begins as a quiet visit turns into something much heavier.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two voices reach out to you for help, both claiming to know what really happened and insisting the other cannot be trusted. Their stories conflict, their motives are unclear, and at the heart of it all lies a girl who hasn\u2019t spoken in a decade. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who you trust, what you uncover, and how you choose to act will determine who is saved\u2026 and who is left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3515710?t=1751305919","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515710/6fc706a6316884aed4d9ccb023b1a564568e6e6b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751305919","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515710/1a28b8d351ad559e85fee9abf6f20e744c114d9a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751305919","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515710/1a28b8d351ad559e85fee9abf6f20e744c114d9a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751305919","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"des